            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Images are not embedded in the HTML output by default. If you have image references in your document, you’ll have to save the image files in the same directory as your converted document."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "As an alternative, you can embed the images directly into the document by setting the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "data-uri"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " document attribute."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= The Dangers of Wolpertingers\n:url-wolpertinger: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wolpertinger\n:imagesdir: my-images\n:data-uri:\n\nDon't worry about gumberoos or splintercats.\nSomething far more fearsome plagues the days, nights, and inbetweens.\nWolpertingers.\n\n== Origins\n\nWolpertingers are {url-wolpertinger}[ravenous beasts].\n[.left.text-center]\nimage:wolpertinger.jpg[Wolpertinger,100,,link=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wolpertinger.jpg\"]\nThey may look cute and cuddly, but don't be fooled."
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "data-uri attribute set in document header"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can also set "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "data-uri"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " using the API or CLI (shown here):"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "literal",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "$ asciidoctor -a data-uri my-document.adoc"
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When you view the HTML file in your browser, you should see the image displayed in the page."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "alt": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "my document with data uri"
              }
            ],
            "attributes": {},
            "context": "image",
            "id": null,
            "roles": [],
            "src": "my-document-with-data-uri.png",
            "svg": null,
            "target": "my-document-with-data-uri.png",
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_embed_images_with_the_data_uri_attribute",
        "level": 1,
